WEBVTT

01:59.180 --> 02:02.180
<i>Turning the love of women into money...</i>

02:02.180 --> 02:05.000
<i>That was how I always did things.</i>

02:05.480 --> 02:07.550
<i>All the women who were dazzled by my status</i>

02:07.550 --> 02:09.800
<i>and came to court me...</i>

02:10.530 --> 02:14.560
<i>Jake Langston's little sister 
was one of them.</i>

02:15.960 --> 02:17.120
<i>But...</i>

02:17.510 --> 02:19.910
<i>Unlike the other women,</i>

02:19.910 --> 02:25.290
<i>she tried to take her own life 
in hopes of saving my soul.</i>

02:27.030 --> 02:31.030
<i>All I did was try to stop her!</i>

02:31.370 --> 02:34.120
What are you doing?! Stop!

02:43.490 --> 02:47.640
N-No... I didn't do this!

02:53.120 --> 02:54.380
Do you...

02:55.330 --> 02:57.210
have money?

02:57.900 --> 03:01.630
Yeah, I guess a guy who tricks a woman 
into financially supporting him

03:01.630 --> 03:03.790
probably wouldn't have money, huh?

03:08.210 --> 03:11.040
Get yourself engaged to that woman.

03:11.350 --> 03:13.360
Her name's Raeliana McMillan.

03:13.790 --> 03:16.540
She's nothing special, 
just a baron's daughter,

03:16.540 --> 03:19.090
but she's one of those "nouveau riche."

03:20.030 --> 03:25.040
And what am I supposed to 
do once I'm engaged to her?

03:30.060 --> 03:33.440
Relax. After you've done it once,

03:33.440 --> 03:36.870
the second time is no big deal.

03:38.750 --> 03:42.200
<i>Right, Francis Brooks?</i>

03:42.970 --> 03:44.320
<i>It's not my fault!</i>

03:45.140 --> 03:47.620
<i>I just had bad luck!</i>

03:48.670 --> 03:51.960
<i>All because I chose that woman...</i>

03:52.820 --> 03:53.950
<i>Damn it!</i>

03:55.670 --> 03:57.070
There's no...

03:57.310 --> 04:01.710
going back now.

04:16.190 --> 04:17.690
<i>Where am I?</i>

04:18.940 --> 04:20.940
You're awake now?

04:22.510 --> 04:27.570
And how are you feeling, Miss McMillan?

04:28.930 --> 04:30.570
Wh-Who are you?

04:31.400 --> 04:35.080
<i>I remember... going to the ball,</i>

04:35.080 --> 04:39.340
<i>and getting close to Marquess Eriteal's 
wife because Noah asked me to...</i>

04:40.310 --> 04:43.830
<i>And then, smoke started filling the room...</i>

04:44.740 --> 04:46.080
<i>Was I abducted?!</i>

04:46.750 --> 04:50.870
<i>There's only one person 
who'd do something like this.</i>

04:50.870 --> 04:52.670
<i>Francis Brooks!</i>

04:53.590 --> 04:55.590
<i>That absolute coward!</i>

04:56.150 --> 04:59.470
What's wrong? Can't even speak?

05:03.740 --> 05:07.900
Come any closer, and I'll scream!

05:09.910 --> 05:11.920
Someone help me!

05:11.920 --> 05:14.430
Hello! Is anyone out there?! Please!

05:14.430 --> 05:15.590
Scream all you want.

05:15.590 --> 05:16.390
Someone!

05:16.390 --> 05:18.660
Nobody's gonna come for you.

05:16.810 --> 05:20.110
Someone... Someone help me!

05:20.110 --> 05:23.320
I've been abducted! 
There's a kidnapper here!

05:23.320 --> 05:27.180
Please! Is anyone out there?! Please!

05:28.230 --> 05:30.890
There's really nobody around?

05:31.370 --> 05:34.700
It'd be smarter of you to just keep quiet.

05:34.700 --> 05:39.690
So long as you do as I say, 
I'll be nice to you.

05:39.990 --> 05:45.470
Don't think you can kidnap 
the beloved fiancée of Duke Wynknight

05:45.470 --> 05:47.520
and get away with it!

05:48.190 --> 05:52.310
<i>Not that I have any love for him, either.</i>

05:52.700 --> 05:57.330
You don't seem to understand 
the situation you're in.

05:57.330 --> 05:59.890
You're the one who doesn't understand!

06:00.400 --> 06:04.710
You won't get any money 
out of killing me here.

06:09.460 --> 06:12.110
Is that supposed to be a threat?

06:12.110 --> 06:14.960
Are you trying to keep me 
from doing anything to you?

06:15.410 --> 06:19.480
So basically, as long as you're 
still alive, anything goes?

06:19.480 --> 06:22.970
<i>No! If he ruins my face...</i>

06:24.740 --> 06:26.390
I'm shorry.

06:26.390 --> 06:27.440
Say what?

06:28.110 --> 06:31.480
I shaid... I'm shorry.

06:35.420 --> 06:37.230
What the hell, girl?

06:37.230 --> 06:39.750
You're actually kinda cute!

06:40.020 --> 06:42.630
Then can you just let me go home now?

06:43.420 --> 06:46.820
You just stay right there and keep quiet.

06:46.820 --> 06:51.630
You don't want your precious face to be hurt 
right before you get married, do you?

06:52.020 --> 06:54.410
<i>He's serious.</i>

06:54.410 --> 06:57.990
<i>He'll really kill me if it comes down to it.</i>

06:59.670 --> 07:01.880
<i>Between this guy and Brooks...</i>

07:02.830 --> 07:06.310
<i>Seems like I'm surrounded 
by horrible people.</i>

07:14.490 --> 07:15.480
Hey.

07:16.710 --> 07:18.750
Why are you doing this?

07:19.910 --> 07:22.690
You can at least tell me 
that much, can't you?

07:26.630 --> 07:28.920
My little sister died.

07:30.940 --> 07:34.550
Sophie died because of him.

07:39.310 --> 07:42.910
Isn't it natural to avenge 
the death of a family member?

07:43.630 --> 07:45.930
Are you saying...

07:45.930 --> 07:48.010
Lord Brooks killed your sister?

07:48.550 --> 07:51.060
Yeah, pretty much.

07:51.900 --> 07:53.620
Your sister...

07:54.650 --> 07:58.830
Your sister wouldn't want you to do this!

07:58.830 --> 07:59.790
What?

07:59.790 --> 08:04.710
If she knew her brother was sullying 
his own hands to avenger her...

08:06.250 --> 08:10.580
It would make your sister in heaven so sad!

08:10.580 --> 08:13.960
So please... stop this foolishness!

08:17.280 --> 08:21.350
Did you actually think platitudes like 
that would convince me?

08:21.350 --> 08:23.600
It'd make my sister sad?

08:23.860 --> 08:28.930
As long as I get my money, 
I don't give a shit about that!

08:32.740 --> 08:37.890
Nobles think they can solve any problem 
as long as they have their status.

08:37.890 --> 08:39.610
What a bunch of idiots.

08:39.890 --> 08:43.090
He's a great example!

08:43.090 --> 08:45.590
The eldest son of the Brooks family,

08:45.590 --> 08:48.620
getting involved in crime 
for the sake of money.

08:49.020 --> 08:52.680
Money is all that really 
matters in this world!

08:52.680 --> 08:57.630
Giving my sister a nice grave 
is what would really make her happy!

08:57.920 --> 09:01.130
She's already dead, after all!

09:01.710 --> 09:03.070
<i>It's no use.</i>

09:03.550 --> 09:06.420
<i>Nothing I say to him will do any good.</i>

09:07.350 --> 09:12.510
<i>Platitudes like those only 
work in books and movies.</i>

09:12.510 --> 09:17.020
<i>Besides, I'm not even 
the protagonist of this story.</i>

09:20.910 --> 09:22.790
Wh-What the...

09:22.790 --> 09:24.310
Langston!

09:25.010 --> 09:26.280
What happened?

09:27.050 --> 09:29.280
A wheel broke.

09:29.280 --> 09:30.590
What?

09:34.540 --> 09:36.310
A landslide, huh?

09:38.180 --> 09:41.380
We'll ditch the carriage 
and head into the woods, then.

09:41.380 --> 09:43.550
You keep an eye on the woman.

09:44.030 --> 09:46.370
<i>What in the world happened?</i>

09:50.550 --> 09:52.880
Francis Brooks...

09:57.710 --> 10:00.860
If you had just been 
a good girl and married me,

10:00.860 --> 10:03.310
everything would have gone smoothly.

10:03.310 --> 10:07.290
If we had gotten married, 
would you have let me live?

10:08.830 --> 10:11.200
I know you wanted to kill me.

10:11.200 --> 10:15.570
You planned to kill me by putting 
arsenic in my evening tea, didn't you?

10:15.570 --> 10:18.330
How... do you...

10:25.590 --> 10:26.960
Raeliana!

10:26.960 --> 10:29.830
Hey! What the hell are you doing?!

10:29.830 --> 10:31.970
She's as quick as a damn mouse!

10:42.240 --> 10:45.230
What in the world is going on?

10:45.750 --> 10:47.930
I don't want to die.

10:47.930 --> 10:51.190
I'm scared. Someone help me.

10:51.190 --> 10:53.240
I want to go home.

10:56.390 --> 10:58.340
Wait, no! Stop!

10:58.340 --> 11:01.360
Why am I setting my own death flags here?!

11:01.360 --> 11:06.250
If I keep this up, I'll just be some 
side character who randomly croaks!

11:06.720 --> 11:10.630
I have to keep it together! 
I can't die here!

11:58.570 --> 12:00.070
Taylor!

12:04.320 --> 12:06.450
You saved me!

12:18.420 --> 12:20.760
Those red eyes...

12:20.760 --> 12:23.840
You must be the famous Adam Taylor.

12:24.340 --> 12:27.100
It's such an honor to meet you.

12:28.010 --> 12:30.100
<i>Wh-What's going on here?</i>

12:31.100 --> 12:33.100
I will handle this.

12:34.190 --> 12:36.440
<i>Is he awaiting my orders?</i>

12:37.400 --> 12:39.610
Master Taylor, have him—

12:39.610 --> 12:44.530
My name is Jake Langston. I'm 27 years old.

12:44.530 --> 12:47.620
As I said earlier, 
my younger sister's already dead,

12:47.620 --> 12:53.000
and my mother was left to live 
alone on our land, drowning in debt.

12:53.000 --> 12:55.750
<i>Where'd all that come from?</i>

12:55.750 --> 13:00.250
The debt's so deep that even if 
we sold the land and our status,

13:00.250 --> 13:02.760
it wouldn't be enough to repay it.

13:02.760 --> 13:07.680
Even my mother, who grew up a noble 
and never wanted for anything,

13:07.680 --> 13:10.510
will have to work until the day she dies.

13:12.310 --> 13:16.520
If I'm apprehended now, 
I'll probably be imprisoned for life.

13:16.980 --> 13:20.270
I doubt they'd execute me, 
since I'm a noble myself.

13:20.270 --> 13:24.190
So yeah, go ahead and kill 
me if you think you can!

13:24.190 --> 13:30.280
But unlike that murderer there, 
I bet you'll never be able to forget me

13:30.280 --> 13:32.330
or my mother, either.

13:33.450 --> 13:36.830
Don't call Master Taylor a murderer!

13:36.830 --> 13:40.790
Oh, come on. That's not 
the important part here, is it?

13:41.040 --> 13:43.800
<i>Everything he says is so infuriating!</i>

13:44.210 --> 13:46.840
<i>But... he's exactly right.</i>

13:46.840 --> 13:50.550
<i>If I kill him here, 
I'll never get over the guilt.</i>

13:51.140 --> 13:55.810
<i>And I don't want to give 
Adam orders to kill anyone.</i>

13:56.100 --> 14:00.400
Master Taylor, would it be 
possible to capture him alive?

14:02.150 --> 14:05.240
<i>Didn't expect them 
to track me down this quickly.</i>

14:05.780 --> 14:07.320
<i>No choice now, I guess.</i>

14:20.830 --> 14:23.840
Hah! Didn't take you long to show up!

14:36.360 --> 14:39.350
<i>Wh-What the heck is this?!</i>

14:39.640 --> 14:43.730
<i>It's a secret drug that lures monsters.</i>

14:43.730 --> 14:47.900
<i>Wasn't expecting it to bag me 
a mountain monkfish, though.</i>

14:56.240 --> 15:01.420
<i>Even Adam Taylor won't have an easy 
time with a monster like that.</i>

15:16.390 --> 15:19.940
Master Taylor! There's a cliff behind us!

15:34.070 --> 15:37.330
<i>Why...</i>

15:37.740 --> 15:41.830
<i>I want to tell Adam to get away 
as quickly as he can, but I...</i>

15:45.500 --> 15:49.050
<i>This feeling of being pushed off 
the edge in the darkness...</i>

15:50.380 --> 15:52.260
<i>I recognize this.</i>

15:53.680 --> 15:55.390
<i>This feeling...</i>

15:56.510 --> 16:00.640
<i>I'm going to end up dead this time, too?</i>

16:20.080 --> 16:21.040
Noah?

16:24.120 --> 16:25.460
Raeliana...

16:28.170 --> 16:31.010
Hang on! Put me down right now!

16:31.010 --> 16:32.720
Just hold still.

16:32.720 --> 16:35.720
Master Taylor is in danger!

16:35.720 --> 16:36.680
Adam is?

16:39.890 --> 16:41.930
We have to hurry!

16:42.390 --> 16:46.190
<i>But... how is he so calm right now?</i>

16:50.650 --> 16:53.190
Looks like he made quite the show of it.

17:08.080 --> 17:13.050
<i>So this isn't even unusual 
to the people of this world?</i>

17:14.050 --> 17:16.050
<i>A monster like this?</i>

17:16.510 --> 17:17.720
<i>It's so hard...</i>

17:18.430 --> 17:20.510
<i>It feels like a rock.</i>

17:20.510 --> 17:23.480
<i>And he took it down so easily?</i>

17:23.770 --> 17:26.560
And you let them go?

17:28.060 --> 17:30.770
<i>If only I hadn't hesitated,</i>

17:30.770 --> 17:34.240
<i>Jake Langston would have been 
apprehended for sure.</i>

17:37.490 --> 17:38.740
My lady!

17:39.280 --> 17:40.740
Dame Ansley!

17:41.160 --> 17:42.540
You aren't hurt, are you?

17:42.540 --> 17:45.660
No. I'm sorry for worrying you.

17:46.830 --> 17:48.750
Anyway, is that...

17:48.750 --> 17:49.750
Yes.

17:49.750 --> 17:53.510
We found him on the road, 
and he fled the moment he saw us.

17:54.010 --> 17:55.880
Th-That's him!

17:55.880 --> 17:59.510
He was working with 
Francis Brooks to abduct me!

17:59.510 --> 18:01.470
We were right to capture him.

18:13.020 --> 18:15.940
Each of you will search
 your assigned areas.

18:16.780 --> 18:20.780
Inform me the moment you 
locate Francis Brooks.

18:20.780 --> 18:21.740
Right!

18:26.790 --> 18:29.040
Thank... you.

18:34.300 --> 18:35.800
A gun?

18:36.970 --> 18:38.300
There he is!

18:49.560 --> 18:52.560
Francis Brooks.

18:53.270 --> 18:55.530
R-Raeliana...

18:55.530 --> 18:59.030
This is all your fault.

18:59.030 --> 19:00.570
Y-You've got it all wrong!

19:00.570 --> 19:03.030
Please, hear me out!

19:03.030 --> 19:04.910
What have I got wrong?

19:05.290 --> 19:06.910
W-Wait!

19:09.540 --> 19:12.630
If you had just been 
a good girl and married me,

19:12.630 --> 19:15.710
everything would have gone smoothly.

19:15.960 --> 19:19.260
If you hadn't been thinking 
about marrying me,

19:19.260 --> 19:22.470
everything would have gone smoothly.

19:34.060 --> 19:36.570
Ah, I feel so much better!

19:36.570 --> 19:39.570
I almost want to take 
a picture to remember this!

19:39.570 --> 19:43.030
Now he'll be in the slammer for life!

19:43.030 --> 19:46.490
That weight is finally off my chest!

19:51.830 --> 19:55.250
I'm actually pretty good with a gun...

20:03.760 --> 20:08.640
<i>Being short on horses really shouldn't 
be an excuse to ride double.</i>

20:09.310 --> 20:14.100
Noah, this horse seems to be moving 
a lot slower than it should.

20:14.100 --> 20:16.360
I wonder whose fault that is.

20:16.770 --> 20:17.770
<i>Damn it! {int}</i>

20:17.650 --> 20:22.900
<b>People I Hate Most</b>

20:17.650 --> 20:22.900
Noah Voltaire Wynknight

20:20.820 --> 20:22.240
I hate you! {main}

20:43.090 --> 20:44.380
Noah...

20:46.930 --> 20:51.270
Thank you... for coming to find me.

20:55.230 --> 20:56.900
You're welcome.

20:57.940 --> 21:02.440
<i>All I did was thank him. 
Why do I feel so embarrassed?</i>

21:04.740 --> 21:07.030
<i>I'm suddenly so sleepy...</i>

21:08.660 --> 21:13.120
<i>But I can't... fall asleep here...</i>

21:21.800 --> 21:25.170
<i>Why... did I feel so angry?</i>

21:26.760 --> 21:30.560
<i>The death of a woman who has dirt on me</i>

21:30.560 --> 21:33.470
<i>should be a good thing for me.</i>

21:37.480 --> 21:38.600
So why?

21:41.730 --> 21:42.940
Adam.

21:45.280 --> 21:46.950
I want you...

21:47.570 --> 21:50.280
to get rid of them.

23:14.700 --> 23:16.790
<i>Morning already?</i>

23:17.410 --> 23:19.620
<i>I wanna sleep a little longer...</i>

23:25.550 --> 23:26.550
You're awake now?

23:35.050 --> 23:40.060
<b>Episode Six</b>

23:35.050 --> 23:40.060
<b>Why Raeliana Cosplayed</b>
